---
boardPermalink: /design/4-islands/
---
{#- Page 4 Islands complète et cohérente (retour du 03.11.2026, point 18), dans l'ordre de 00-BRIEF §6.2.
    Sert aussi aux cadres mobiles de la planche /design/. Jamais en production. -#}
{% import "components/stt.njk" as stt %}
{% from "components/booking.njk" import bookingSheet %}
{%- set t = page -%}
{%- set slots = buildContext.showPhotoSlots -%}
{%- set fallback = stt.waHref(boardContact.number, t.fallback) -%}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-GB" data-board>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
<title>4 Islands boat tour from Koh Lanta, design board</title>
{% include "board-head-stt.njk" %}
</head>
<body class="has-mbar">
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
{{ stt.header("boat-trips", boardContact, emblem.header, site) }}

<main id="main" class="wrap">
  {#- Haut de page de la maquette m2 : texte et billet sur 6 colonnes, photo sur 6 ; sur téléphone, la photo
      passe en tête, pleine largeur. Seules les vraies photos s'affichent (règle « moins d'images »). -#}
  <div class="grid pg-hero">
    <div class="c-6">
      {{ stt.breadcrumb([{ label: "Home", href: "/" }, { label: "Boat trips", href: "/tours/#boat-trips" }, { label: t.name }]) }}
      <h1>{{ t.h1 }}</h1>
      <p class="lead">{{ t.lead }}</p>
      {{ stt.ticket(t.ticket, "Key facts, " + t.name) }}
      <div class="pg-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ fallback }}" data-book="{{ t.price.option }}">Check availability</a>
        <a class="link-wa" href="{{ stt.waHref(boardContact.number) }}">Ask on WhatsApp</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pg-photo">{{ stt.gallery(t.gallery, "Photos, " + t.name, false) }}</div>
  </div>

  <section class="pg-sec" aria-labelledby="h-day">
    <h2 id="h-day">{{ t.day.title }}</h2>
    {{ stt.routeLine(t.day.steps, t.day.note) }}
  </section>

  <section class="pg-sec" id="prices" aria-labelledby="h-prices">
    <h2 id="h-prices">Choose your boat</h2>
    {{ stt.optionsPrices(t.options) }}
  </section>

  <div class="grid pg-sec pg-two">
    <section class="c-6" aria-labelledby="h-incl">
      <h2 id="h-incl">What's in the price</h2>
      {{ stt.included(t.included, t.notIncluded) }}
    </section>
    <div class="c-6">{{ stt.beforeBook(t.beforeBook) }}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid pg-sec pg-two">
    <section class="c-7" aria-labelledby="h-faq">
      <h2 id="h-faq">Questions</h2>
      {{ stt.faq(t.faq) }}
    </section>
    <div class="c-5">{{ stt.whoRuns(board.who) }}</div>
  </div>

  <section class="pg-sec" aria-labelledby="h-related">
    <h2 id="h-related">More boat trips</h2>
    {{ stt.related(t.related, t.transfer, false) }}
  </section>
</main>

{{ stt.footer(site, boardContact, emblem.footer) }}
{{ stt.mobileBar(t.price, fallback) }}
{{ bookingSheet(t.booking, boardContact) }}
<script src="/js/booking.js?v={{ build.v }}" defer></script>
<script src="/js/ui.js?v={{ build.v }}" defer></script>
{% include "board-tools.njk" %}
</body>
</html>
